                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level1\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">lang <span>(apiLanguage)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>\n                    <span>Możliwe wartości:\n                    </span> (<i>eng, pol, ger</i>)</p><p>Język API</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div></div>\n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"reservations\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level0 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">reservations <span>(editReservationsStatusTypeArray)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Dane rezerwacji</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name=\"editReservationsStatusType\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level1 toggle\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\"> <span>(editReservationsStatusType)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>element typu editReservationsStatusType</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        \n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"reservationId\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level2\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">reservationId <span>(int)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>Identyfikator rezerwacji</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"status\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level2\">\n                        <strong class=\"api_required required_after\">status <span>(reservationStatusType)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>\n                    <span>Możliwe wartości:\n                    </span> (<i>unconfirmed, confirmed, paymentInProgress, accepted, inProgress, completed, canceled, withdrawn, waitingForPayment, invalidCardNumber, toClarify</i>)</p><p>Typ statusu rezerwacji</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"notify\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level2\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">notify <span>(notifyType)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>\n                    <span>Możliwe wartości:\n                    </span> (<i>y, n</i>)</p><p>Powiadamiaj wiadomością transakcyjną</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div>\n            <div class=\"api_details_item_sub\">\n            \n                <div class=\"api_details_item\" data-parameter-name=\"notifyService\">\n                    <div class=\"api_details_item_inner level2\">\n                        <strong class=\"\">notifyService <span>(notifyServiceType)</span></strong>\n                        <span><p>\n                    <span>Możliwe wartości:\n                    </span> (<i>y, n</i>)</p><p>Wysyłaj powiadomienia dla obsługi obiektu. Domyślnie są wysyłane</p></span>\n                    </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n        <div id=\"api_method_response_json\" class=\"mb-5\"><div class=\"api_method_header px-3\"><div class=\"api_method_header_left d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center justify-content-sm-between align-items-center\"><div><i class=\"icon-code\"></i> \n            <strong>Struktura odpowiedzi</strong></div></div></div><div id=\"api_method_response_content\" class=\"api_details visible\">\n                <div class=\"api_details_item open\" data-parameter-name